#ASSERT `reg 70(7) the warrant authorises the executing officer` TRUE TRUE `reg 70(7)(b) to search the premises and take possession of documents or information of the relevant kind, or take any other steps necessary for preserving them or preventing interference with them` EQUALS JUST TRUE
