#ASSERT `reg 70(9) a warrant may have the feature` TRUE `reg 70(9)(b) the warrant may authorise persons to accompany any executing officer who is executing it` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 70(9) a warrant may have the feature` TRUE `reg 70(9)(c) the warrant may be issued subject to conditions` EQUALS JUST TRUE
