#ASSERT `reg 70(11) sections 15(5) to (8) and 16(3) to (12) of the Police and Criminal Evidence Act 1984 apply to the warrant` `Northern Ireland` EQUALS NOTHING -- reg 70(12) speaks to Northern Ireland, with its own Order
#ASSERT `reg 70(12) Articles 17(5) to (8) and 18(3) to (12) of the Police and Criminal Evidence (Northern Ireland) Order 1989 apply to the warrant` `Northern Ireland` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 70(12) Articles 17(5) to (8) and 18(3) to (12) of the Police and Criminal Evidence (Northern Ireland) Order 1989 apply to the warrant` `England and Wales` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Regulation 71`

#ASSERT `reg 71(1) the seized material may be retained` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 71(1) the seized material may be retained` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- no longer necessary to retain it rather than copies
#ASSERT `reg 71(1) the seized material may be retained` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not taken under regulation 66 or 70
