#ASSERT `reg 71(2) the seized material may be retained until the proceedings are concluded` NOTHING FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- a definite no wins over an answer that is not in
#ASSERT `reg 71(2) the seized material may be retained until the proceedings are concluded` NOTHING TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
