#ASSERT `reg 71(3) the person may apply for delivery to` TRUE Scotland EQUALS JUST `reg 71(3) the sheriff or the summary sheriff`
#ASSERT `reg 71(3) the person may apply for delivery to` FALSE Scotland EQUALS NOTHING
