#ASSERT `reg 71(4) the court may make such order as it thinks fit` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- failed "if" (marginal reading (a)) (was NOTHING): the court can ascertain who is the owner
#ASSERT `reg 71(4) the court may make such order as it thinks fit` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- failed "if" (marginal reading (a)) (was NOTHING): no application under paragraph (3)
