§§ `Regulation 74A`

`cryptoasset exchange provider alone` MEANS LIST `cryptoasset exchange provider`
`a custodian wallet provider and a high value dealer` MEANS LIST `custodian wallet provider`, `high value dealer`
`an estate agent` MEANS LIST `estate agent`
-- 74A(1).  Arguments: kinds; directed; (a) compliance; (b) charges; (c) otherwise reasonably required.
#ASSERT `reg 74A(1) the cryptoasset business must provide the information to the FCA` `cryptoasset exchange provider alone` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74A(1) the cryptoasset business must provide the information to the FCA` `a custodian wallet provider and a high value dealer` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a custodian wallet provider; charges under regulation 102
#ASSERT `reg 74A(1) the cryptoasset business must provide the information to the FCA` `cryptoasset exchange provider alone` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74A(1) the cryptoasset business must provide the information to the FCA` `cryptoasset exchange provider alone` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- none of the three heads
#ASSERT `reg 74A(1) the cryptoasset business must provide the information to the FCA` `cryptoasset exchange provider alone` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not directed
#ASSERT `reg 74A(1) the cryptoasset business must provide the information to the FCA` `an estate agent` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- not a cryptoasset exchange provider or custodian wallet provider
-- 74A(2).
#ASSERT `reg 74A(2) the information was provided as the FCA directed` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74A(2) the information was provided as the FCA directed` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the FCA directed only the times
#ASSERT `reg 74A(2) the information was provided as the FCA directed` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not in the form directed
#ASSERT `reg 74A(2) the information was provided as the FCA directed` NOTHING NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not verified as directed
#ASSERT `reg 74A(2) the information was provided as the FCA directed` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- the FCA gave no direction on time, form or verification

§§ `Regulation 74B`

-- 74B(1).  Arguments: the FCA reasonably considers; kinds.
#ASSERT `reg 74B(1) this regulation applies` TRUE `cryptoasset exchange provider alone` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(1) this regulation applies` TRUE `a custodian wallet provider and a high value dealer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(1) this regulation applies` FALSE `cryptoasset exchange provider alone` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- ruled 2026-11-05 (b) where (was NOTHING): the FCA does not consider a report required
#ASSERT `reg 74B(1) this regulation applies` TRUE `an estate agent` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- ruled 2026-11-05 (b) where (was NOTHING): a relevant person who is neither a cryptoasset exchange provider nor a custodian wallet provider
-- 74B(2).  Arguments: regulation applies; notice in writing; the step.
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2) the FCA may take the step` (JUST TRUE) TRUE `reg 74B(2)(a) require the relevant person by notice in writing to appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2) the FCA may take the step` (JUST TRUE) FALSE `reg 74B(2)(a) require the relevant person by notice in writing to appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS NOTHING -- not by notice in writing
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2) the FCA may take the step` (JUST TRUE) FALSE `reg 74B(2)(b) itself appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2) the FCA may take the step` (JUST FALSE) TRUE `reg 74B(2)(b) itself appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "This regulation applies where" and it does not (ruled 2026-11-05 (b); was NOTHING)
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2) the FCA may take the step` NOTHING TRUE `reg 74B(2)(b) itself appoint a skilled person to provide the FCA with a report on the matter concerned` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2)(b) the fee payable by the relevant person is` TRUE 1250 EQUALS JUST 1250 -- the expenses incurred, recovered as a fee
#ASSERT `reg 74B(2)(b) the fee payable by the relevant person is` FALSE 1250 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 74B(3) the FCA may require` TRUE `reg 74B(3)(a) the report to be in such form as may be specified in the notice` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(3) the FCA may require` TRUE `reg 74B(3)(b) that the contract between the skilled person and the relevant person contain certain terms that the FCA considers appropriate` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(3) the FCA may require` TRUE `reg 74B(3) some other requirement` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 74B(3) the FCA may require` FALSE `reg 74B(3)(a) the report to be in such form as may be specified in the notice` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not acting under paragraph (2)(a): "When acting under paragraph (2)(a)" (ruled 2026-11-05 (b), read from "when"; was NOTHING)
#ASSERT `reg 74B(4) the FCA gave notice in writing of the appointment` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(4) the FCA gave notice in writing of the appointment` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(4) the FCA gave notice in writing of the appointment` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 74B(5) the person is a skilled person` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the FCA appoints
#ASSERT `reg 74B(5) the person is a skilled person` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the relevant person appoints, with the FCA's nomination or approval
#ASSERT `reg 74B(5) the person is a skilled person` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- the relevant person appoints without the FCA's nomination or approval
#ASSERT `reg 74B(5) the person is a skilled person` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(6) the person gave the skilled person the assistance` TRUE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(6) the person gave the skilled person the assistance` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a connected person
#ASSERT `reg 74B(6) the person gave the skilled person the assistance` TRUE NOTHING FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 74B(6) the person gave the skilled person the assistance` FALSE (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING -- neither the relevant person nor a connected person
#ASSERT `reg 74B(6) the person gave the skilled person the assistance` FALSE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

